From 0279939e7ac385ff44d1716b9bf2bce4db915955 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Ersin=20KO=C3=87?= <ersinkoc@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 19:23:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(tui): the pairing card and the join screen, layout only
 (ADR-0065, waits for the pairing schema)

agora_tui::pair: card_lines (a machine or a browser asking, the number set apart, what to compare, y/n) and join_lines (looking,
found, waiting with the number, approved, denied, expired), from plain view-models; the words match the web's pair-* (#610) as
tui-pair-*/tui-join-* in en/tr. Everything the other side sends is one plain line. No protocol or schema yet.
---
